{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o060a","title":"毕谌因家属被劫离曹操","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o060a-account","label":"正文","text":"回叙曹操领兖州时任毕谌别驾，张邈叛后劫其家属，毕谌表忠后仍逃归。","evidence":["wudi-e-o060a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"任用遣还","evidence":["wudi-e-o060a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0152","role":"离军","evidence":["wudi-e-o060a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0062","role":"劫持家属","evidence":["wudi-e-o060a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"张邈叛迎吕布时","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-o060a-q"]},"source_order":[1,341,"O060a"],"order":153}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0062","name":"张邈","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0152","name":"毕谌","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o060a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2bde65a483eb28ed5e1a","layer":"original","quote":"初，公为兖州，以东平毕谌为别驾〖10〗。张邈之叛也，邈劫谌母弟妻子。公谢遣之，曰：“卿老母在彼，可去。”谌顿首无二心，公嘉之，为之流涕。既出，遂亡归〖11〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":340,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
